From 4709321334ed70f0833fc02dd0715fe04d1cdd81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (BOR AI audit)" <claude@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:44:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(limits): daily usage limits (guest 15, account 150,
 global 1500) for AI cost protection

- migration 0002 daily_usage (additive); atomic check-and-consume per UTC day
- multi-agent request = 3 units; units refunded when the AI call fails
- guest identified only by a daily-rotating hash of the IP (raw IP never stored)
- missing table => chat keeps working, limits disabled, loud log; other DB errors fail closed (503)
- clear 429 messages (code daily_limit); client hides the useless retry button
- env overrides DAILY_LIMIT_GUEST/USER/GLOBAL, optional USAGE_SALT
- tests on real SQLite: limits, weights, refund, global cap, day rollover, IP privacy, fail modes
